{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_11207340","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11207340","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120733001:":{"text":"よく考えろ。","source_cn":"你们可给我想清楚了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE684AFB66C0C6EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:2:1120733002:":{"text":"これが最後のチャンスなんだぞ！","source_cn":"这是最后一次机会！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2515C84E609B497","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120734001:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">キーク</style>、これが最後の警告だ。","source_cn":"这是我最后一次警告你，<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF8931044DA8CCD17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120734002:0":{"text":"サンドクローにはいずれ新しいボスが誕生する……それがこのオレ、ルースだ！オレはギヴィルを倒してボスになる、今すぐオレの下につけばまだ間に合うぞ！","source_cn":"流沙之爪迟早会有新首领——那就是我，鲁斯！你要是现在投...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x345C26468D2C13BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120734003:0":{"text":"だが身の振りを間違えたら、これまでのよしみなんてないものと思えよ！","source_cn":"但要是不知好歹，就别怪我不顾念以前的情分了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x990A8E0391D9DC3E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","documen